      "kappa_iqr suggests distributional competition geometry can beat mean kappa in saturated generation settings."
    ],
    "what_fails_or_weakens": [
      "Raw trace-ratio kappa does not beat effective rank, Fisher, or dist_ratio on cross-model R2 in the old layer-sweep artifact.",
